      "message": "Hi Diana and Abe, can you take a look at this update?\nThis alters some of the work done in https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/3902611 and https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/4104563 but it will still allow the updated drivers to treat USB_PD_MUX_SAFE_MODE like USB_PD_MUX_NONE.\n\nBasically, the cros_ec_typec driver maintains the \"Host\" or \"Device\" role in safe mode, and needs the connection polarity in safe mode to function properly. Let me know if you have any questions.",
